{
  "summary": "This experiment tested weighted fusion in a multimodal multiprofile setup using the advanced imagenet_vit_l image encoder, comparing it to concat fusion (config_024). Validation accuracy of 0.6352 (F1: 0.6183) slightly improves over the concat baseline (0.6287 accuracy, 0.5993 F1), suggesting weighted fusion may offer marginal gains. However, the exact contribution of fusion strategy versus other factors like the image encoder remains uncertain without further isolation of variables."
}

